        {
          "type": "user",
          "text": "<command-message>openspec-explore</command-message>\n<command-name>/openspec-explore</command-name>\n<command-args>I want to implement the https://github.com/leon0399/llame/issues/307. Let's omit eval step and just implement it, we have enough signal from the industry that it works.\n\nSome requirements from the top of the mind:\n- gated by the separate setting for \"share recent chat history for new chats\" (or similar wording) setting in the Personalization settings (do not spec the UI, only API)\n- additionally, let's add the setting \"allow assistant searching previous chats\" (or similar wording) to gate our currently always-shared chat search tool for the model\n- the chats should be inserted in the system prompt entirely by the system prompt template and handlebars, e.g., the following:\n  ```\n  {{#if user.personalization.recentChats}} // gated by the \"share recent chat history for new chats\", just explained in the description that it also shares pinned ones\n    Below are user's other pinned chats with you\n    {{#each user.personalization.recentChats}}\n    <pinned-chat>\n    Title: {{this.title}}\n\n    First user's message:\n\n    {{this.messages.0}}\n    </pinned-chat>\n    {{/each}}\n    {{/if}\n\n  {{#if user.personalization.recentChats}} // gated by the \"share recent chat history for new chats\"\n  Below are user's other recent chats with you\n  {{#each user.personalization.recentChats}}\n  <recent-chat>\n  Title: {{this.title}}\n       \n  First user's message:\n\n  {{this.messages.0}}\n  </recent-chat>\n  {{/each}}\n  {{/if}\n  ```\n\nLet's explore other potential requirements and caveats before properly running openspec proposal</command-args>",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-12T04:14:07.034Z"
